# home-from-admin -- return-nav from the Admin menu BACK to home.
# [stol:ui-planner-cov-starts] Declares a non-boot start so A* routes back to home
# via nav_admin_to_home -- the return-nav an all-boot-start corpus never exercises
# (context(home) IS the boot start, so A* never routes to it). The SETUP route
# home->admin (nav_home_to_admin) is driven first at --run but is NOT part of this
# measured plan.
# start: context(admin)
context(home)
